# L §3.3 (round 6): "Any pairing with day other than a daily r ... is refused (LOAD-UNIT where load sees the rate's
# period ...)": the rate is written inline, `1 %/month` (L §7.1: 1 with a unit), so load sees a monthly r over a day.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

def p: num = periodic(1 %/month, day, simple)

ask a: p
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT ...
